# Template repo only, and the one line here the CLI does not generate: a
# committed lock pins everyone who clicks "Use this template" to the dependency
# set of the last regeneration, while the ranges are written to resolve the
# newest minor. A scaffolded APP should commit its lockfile, so the template
# cannot carry this. Preserve it across regenerations, with the README banner
# and the LICENSE.
package-lock.json
